OL,3,GNEWSACouple complete fastest cycle
OL,4,Aaround the world
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cycling couple have broken a record,
OL,7,Fand possibly a collarbone, by pedalling
OL,8,Facross the globe in 123 days.
OL,10,FAmy and Kyle Hudson, both 30, from
OL,11,FMickleover in Derby, biked over 18,000
OL,12,Fmiles through 20 countries, including
OL,13,FMalaysia, New Zealand, Canada, USA and
OL,14,FSpain.
OL,16,FKyle injured his shoulder in a crash
OL,17,Fwith a car in Canada with only two
OL,18,Fweeks of their journey remaining, but
OL,19,Fwas determined to pedal through the
OL,20,Frest of their trip.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
