OL,3,GNEWSACouple complete fastest cycle
OL,4,Aaround the world
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's been so amazing and I just can't
OL,7,Fbelieve that we're here and we're ahead
OL,8,Fof our schedule," Amy said.
